OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHigh pressure brings another
OL,6,Fsettled and largely dry day, with
OL,7,Fsunny spells, variable cloud and light
OL,8,Fwinds. Cloudier across northern
OL,9,FScotland, where there is a slight
OL,10,Fchance of an isolated shower.
OL,11,FTemperatures will be a little higher
OL,12,Fthan on Saturday.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRemaining dry and settled
OL,15,Fovernight, with clear spells for many.
OL,16,FIt will always be a little cloudier
OL,17,Facross Scotland, with an increased
OL,18,Fchance of a shower in the far
OL,19,Fsouthwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
