OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA chilly start across the
OL,6,Fnorth, but another fine and dry day
OL,7,Ffor many. Skies turning hazy across
OL,8,FDevon and Cornwall during the
OL,9,Fafternoon with an increased chance of
OL,10,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
